<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Rage</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>rage
</pre>
<p>A barbarian can work themselves into a red fury before a fight. For one 
to two and a half minutes you are stronger, so you hit harder, but less 
nimble, so you are easier to hit. The better your rage skill and 
strength, the stronger and longer the fury.
</p><p>Start it before you charge in: you can't start a rage in the middle of 
a fight. You need at least 50 endurance; a rage costs 20 to 50 of it, 
and a failed try costs 25. Rage and berserk don't mix: you can't go 
berserk while raging, nor rage while berserk.
</p><p>The Barbarians teach rage from guild level 0.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
